  "verseCount": 12,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "56",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ISA 56"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "56",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abanto ba Nyasae bararwe ase ebisaku bionsi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: “Renda ayare ay’oboronge oyakore, ekiagera ogotooreka kwane nigo kore ang’e gocha, na bwango oboronge bwane mbooroke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nasesenirie oyo ogokora ayio, Mwanyabaanto oyo okoyabwata bokong’u, oyio okorenda Esabato, tayekora ebe eyetachenegeti, omonto oyio ogotanga okoboko kwaye tigokora amabe ande onsi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonto bw’egesaku ekeao obwatanire n’Omonene tabaisa goteeba iga: “Ekeene, Omonene nigo aranyatanane korwa ase abanto baye”, na oyo ore omogomba tateeba iga: “Rora, inche nigo inde omote omwomo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene agoteeba: “Abanto abagomba abarendete Chisabato chiane, abwo bachorire gokora ogwancha kwane, naende babwatete okobwatana kwane kw’ogotianania,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amarieta abo nainyorwe ime ase enyomba yane, na ime ye chindwaki chiane. Ayio nabe ogosesenigwa kobua abana abamura na abaiseke. Nimbae erieta ria kare na kare ritasirigwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abanto b’ebisaku ebiaao barabwatane n’Omonene ase okomokorera, na banche erieta ri’Omonene, erinde babe abasomba baye, kera oyomo oraarende Esabato na tayekora ebe eyetachenegeti, naende abwate okobwatana kwane kw’ogotianania,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abwo bonsi nimbarente ase egetunwa kiane egechenu, mbakore babe nomogooko ime ase enyomba yane y’ogosaba. Ekero barabe bakorua ebing’wanso biabo bi’ogosambwa, na ebing’wanso binde, igoro ase egesasiimero kiane, nimbianchere, ekiagera enyomba yane nerokwe enyomba y’ogosaba ase abanto b’ebisaku bionsi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aya nar’Omonene, oyio ogosangereria Abaisraeli abaseretigwe, agoteeba: “Ninsangererie abanto bande abaao amo kobua abwo konya basangererigwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abatang’ani b’Abaisraeli bakonacherwa ekiina",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inwe ching’iti chionsi chi’orosana, inwe ching’iti chionsi chi’amanani, inchwo morie!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abarendi b’abaanto aba nigo bare emeuko, bonsi pi tibari nokomanya, bonsi nigo bare chisese chinkubu chitanyare gokoga; nigo chiraire inse chikorota, chianchete obogondereria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisese echio nigo chire chindia bobe, tichiri koigota. Na abarisia boigo tibari nobong’aini; bonsi baonchokeire chinchera chiabo, kera oyomo nigo akwerigeria ebitoki korwa ase kera emeremo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 56:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo agoteeba: “Inchuo mbanyorere edivai tonywe, totinde nekenyugwa egetindi, rituko ri’ankio nabo rirabe rinene buna reero, naende rietanie eri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.56.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.56.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
